{"hw":"ξενόω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ξενόω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ξεν-όω</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ξεινόω</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">ξένος</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">make one's friend and guest, entertain,</b> in <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">ξενοῦμαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Supp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">927</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.R.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.849</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ξενώσεται</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lyc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">92</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> mostly in <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, with <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">ξενώσομαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">303</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐξένωμαι</span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐξενώθην</span> (<span class=\"gk\">ἐξενώθησαν Ἀττικῶς: ἐξενίσθησαν Ἑλληνικῶς</span> Moer.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">p.167</span> </span> P.): </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">1</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">enter into a treaty of hospitality with</b> one, <span class=\"gk\">πόλιες ἀλλήλῃσι ἐξεινώθησαν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.21</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">642e</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ages.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.5</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">βασιλεῦσιν ἐξενωμένος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.48</span> </span>: abs., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.1.34</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">take up</b> one's <b class=\"lex-tr\">abode with</b> one <b class=\"lex-tr\">as a guest, to be entertained,</b> <span class=\"gk\">Θήβᾳ ξενωθείς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">P.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.299</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ch.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">702</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> </span> l. c., etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ξενωθεὶς τοῖσδ' ἐν.. δόμοις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Alc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">68</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ξενοῦται τῷ Ξενοφῶντι, [παρ'] Ἑλλάδι,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.8.6</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ξενωθεὶς ὑπὸ τᾶς βουλᾶς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12(1).383</span> </span> (Rhodes). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">reside abroad,</b> <span class=\"gk\">δαρὸν ἐξενωμένου</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">65</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ion</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">820</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">go into banishment,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hipp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1085</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> later, in <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Act.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">deprive</b> one <b class=\"lex-tr\">of</b> a thing, <span class=\"gk\">[τινά] τινος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hld.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.7</span> </span>.</div></div>"}